  "label": "User projected onto the distressed woman as the victim",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the distressed woman (entity: woman) and the textual material 'this victimizes me' (text_chunk_1), which explicitly uses 'me' to indicate self-identification with the victim role. The user sees themselves in the woman's emotional state and the situation described, making the projection onto the woman and the text. The phrase 'this victimizes me' directly deictically refers to the user as the victim, establishing a strong semiotic projection.",
